{"id":"fcdd074c-81ed-4df5-a397-5e1a05709079","expr":"args != null","rationale":"The main method is always called with at least an empty array, so args should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Calc#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:43.690458Z"}
{"id":"0813a6cc-25bb-450f-8281-c14e851ef9b4","expr":"b != null && b.doubleValue() != 0.0","rationale":"Division by zero is prevented by this check, so b must not be null or zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Calc#safeDivide(T,T):T","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:45.137418Z"}
{"id":"65db82a1-e808-4454-b8a9-587233832a8e","expr":"a != null","rationale":"Input 'a' must not be null for the method to work.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Calc#safeDivide(T,T):T","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:45.137418Z"}
{"id":"2fa5ce0b-81b3-4ecc-825a-759d933ce257","expr":"args != null","rationale":"Method parameters in Java are non-null unless explicitly allowed, so args should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Calc#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:45.655828Z"}
{"id":"a8e6471d-85dc-4d0d-919d-c1919c4fc66a","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Calc#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:45.655828Z"}
{"id":"9ec79e94-adfb-4f82-b3bc-fef743e4c69d","expr":"args.length == 0 || args[0] != null","rationale":"If args has length > 0, the first element may be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Calc#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:45.655828Z"}
{"id":"616eaa30-32de-48ed-ac9f-3e61ab974773","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Method returns null only if division by zero, but at exit, result is assigned and method did not return early with null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Calc#safeDivide(T,T):T","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:46.151570Z"}
{"id":"55a67572-6777-4e3f-9026-94359d279c75","expr":"result.doubleValue() == a.doubleValue() / b.doubleValue()","rationale":"Result is computed as division of a by b, in appropriate numeric form.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Calc#safeDivide(T,T):T","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:18:46.151570Z"}
